3. Third-party JavaScript inside libs/*/javadoc/assets/ - MIT / BSD / GPL
================================================================================
These files belong to the generated Android Javadoc asset set, which is checked into
this repository four times: libs/libccplugin_vm, libs/libccplugin_log,
libs/libccplugin_islet_realm and libs/libccplugin_android_mockups. The
jquery-history.js, jquery-resizable.min.js, prettify.js and doclava-* assets are
present in all four copies; assets/LICENSE.txt, the assets/js/ bundle,
assets/GPL-LICENSE.txt, assets/android-developer-docs.css and assets/css/default.css
only in the libs/libccplugin_islet_realm and libs/libccplugin_android_mockups copies.
