4. Note on the generated documentation
================================================================================
libs/*/javadoc/ is generated output (688 of the 868 files tracked in this repository)
kept in version control for convenience. Everything described in sections 2 and 3 that
lives inside those directories originates from the Android documentation tooling and
can be regenerated; the only change of ours is the docs.js stripping noted above.
Removing these directories from version control would also remove all of section 3 from
the distributed sources.
